### M2-Planet ends its output with :ELF_end, the label the ELF header it was
### written for expects; lib/m2/x86/PE32-i386.hex2 expects :PE_end.  This is
### assembled last, so the two name the same address, and M2-Planet needs no
### change.  Everything past here is the mapped, zeroed memory crt1.M1 divides
### up and brk hands out.
:PE_end
